# @hub-lanes

# orchestrator 5-min no-AI status monitor (operator line, outside managed blocks; the operator 2026-09-07
# "loop to monitor this every 5 minutes"). BH-9074: the line runs the repo's gated wrapper
# bin/orc-monitor.sh, which applies the lane switches and the lane wake gate, then execs the hub
# script /root/orchestrator/bin/orc-monitor.sh (still hub-only, not repo-managed).
# The */5 tick runs behind bin/lib/cadence-backstop.sh: row
# lib.cadence-backstop.cadence_backstop_min_orc_monitor (default 0 = every tick, as before;
# 30 = one backstop tick per half hour, for when calendar rings wake it).
# Kill: touch /root/orchestrator/flags/monitor-off (or bin/harness-ctl.sh off orc-monitor)
*/5 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && { /root/harness/bin/lib/cadence-backstop.sh orc-monitor; [ $? -ne 3 ]; } && /root/harness/bin/orc-monitor.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
